==Battleground==
*2 [[Satan Claus|Satan Clauses]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 33 seconds<sup>990f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns.
*5 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 14~20 seconds<sup>420f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~27 seconds<sup>600f~810f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 55 seconds<sup>1,650f</sup>, delay 20~27 seconds<sup>600f~810f</sup>.
*4 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 55 seconds<sup>1,650f</sup>, delay 25 seconds<sup>750f</sup>.
*4 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~25 seconds<sup>600f~750f</sup>.
*5 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] and, if you have any, some [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] that have 500+ range, [[:Category:Cats with Freeze Immunity|Freeze-immune cats]] are also very good. [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Aphrodite]] makes this stage a cakewalk due to her massive long-ranged damage against Satan Claus and other [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]]. [[Aer (Uber Rare Cat)|Aer]] can also help.

